%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: GoodMoniEnd
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (I...)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (I'm a bit worried about tomorrow.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118603885641743
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Like I said earlier, there's no way of knowing how the others will take
      the truth <i>before</i> we tell them.)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (But that's just <i>part</i> of it-)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118603885641744
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Since {mc} doesn't seem to be in the mood to...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118603885641745
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Do much of anything, really-)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118603885641746
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (I'll probably have to leave him alone to go collect the girls.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118603885641747
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (And, uh, I'm pretty sure you're not supposed to leave people alone when
      they're in a condition like {mc}'s.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360136931148017
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (It might be okay if I could rely on <b>you</b> to keep an eye on him,
      but I'm pretty sure that would do more harm than good.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360136931148018
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (It's a shame he doesn't know how great <b>you</b> are like I do, ahaha!)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118603885641748
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Aaahh...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118603885641749
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (In all seriousness, from what I've seen he looks visibly worse whenever
      <b>you're</b> present.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118603885641750
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Which isn't great for morale going forward, since <b>you're</b> not
      going anywhere.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118603885641751
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (I hope...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118603885641752
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (I'm not sure if you have much control over when and where <b>you</b>
      end up, but if you do-)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Could <b>you</b> please make sure to let me know if he does something...
      desperate?)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118603885641753
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Alright.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118603885641754
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Speaking of being in control of where and when <b>you</b> are-)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Do you know where the other girls will be tomorrow?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118603885641756
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
    dialog: All three of them will be spending the night in Winterhold; Natsuki might
      start heading back to Whiterun tomorrow.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360136931148019
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (So I should head off to Winterhold first thing in the morning, then.)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Did Natsuki have something to do up there?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118603885641757
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
    dialog: She was curing her, and the previous leader of the Companions', lycanthropy.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Farewell werewolf Natsuki, I barely knew you.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118603885641758
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (So she got rid of her wolf ears?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118603885641759
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
    dialog: Actually no, she still has them.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Huh.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360136931148020
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (To be honest, I think she looks cuter with those ears; they also help
      her look a bit taller.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118603885641760
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Anything else important to note?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118603885641761
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
    dialog: Yuri's making progress on learning teleportation, Sayori's been sick
      all day, and Natsuki might be the new leader of the Companions.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (... Dang, the girls have been getting busy!)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118603885641762
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Well, except for Sayori; poor thing.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118603885641763
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Hopefully she'll be better by tomorrow.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118603885641764
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (I doubt any unwanted delays would do {mc} any good.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118603885641765
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (...)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Good night, I'll see <b>you</b> tomorrow; we've got a big day ahead
      of us.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118603885641766
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Monika gets ready for bed, slips herself under the covers, and falls
      asleep.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118603885641767
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118603885641768
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions: []
